        "notes": "**ROUND 1**\n\n-  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n-  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n-  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n\nThese items provide good healing output and good firepower for the start of the game. I've noticed a consistent 3k - 5k heals at the end of the match with everything listed.  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) allows good survivability for a green power.\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nPlay like ordinary  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da), annoyingly. This allows you to just stay alive, which is what we want!",
