        "notes": "**ROUND 2**\n\n*If* all goes well, you should have earned around 11k - 13.5k at this point. If you've earned more, CONGRATS!! That will help us majorly. For this round, I will need you to buy:\n\n-  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) \n-  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \n-  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) \n\nThese items will provide you with incredible uptime with your healing, as at this point you will have 25% attack speed! However, if you've fallen a little bit short for cash last round due to underperformance, then no worries! Focus on survivability **at all costs!!**\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nYou can keep playing exactly how you played last time, annoyingly!! *Although*, if you really want to, you can be a little bit pokey. Just make sure you don't poke too hard, or your team will suffer the consequences of your own actions. Whenever you get a tiny gap between healing, help out your tank by either damage boosting or shooting a round of bullets into the enemy.",
