        "notes": "**ROUND 3**\n\nYou should be earning a huge amount of cash at this point, enough for your whole team!! Ideally, you should be earning around 22k to 25k cash at this point. If not, that is once again okay!! This round, I need you to buy:\n\n-   [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \n-  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) \n\nThis item is absolutely a necessary requirement for this build! If you cannot afford it, sell one or two of your green items. I would ideally sell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) as the healing speed of [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) allows for very high output paired with  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \n\nYour power,  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) , is amazing for this build as you can focus less on healing your team while ulting and bring out the blippy.\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nIf you are struggling a little bit to survive, just be annoying and Guardian Angel to every single ally that is alone to keep your survivability as high as physically possible. If you're dealing with a pesky  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) in your backlines, inform your current teammates on the field and just keep zipping about! If you're dealing with a hefty damage dealer like  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) or  [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) just make sure to get the hell outta there and fall back with your tank.",
