        "notes": "**ROUND 4**\n\nIf you were struggling a lot last round, it should be picking up by now! If not, that is unfortunate but still okay! This round provides you with a bunch more power in your staff and blaster! I am going to need you to purchase:\n\n-  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\nThis is incredibly useful for your build! Invest into it as much as you can! If you cannot afford it, that is alright! You can put your cash into  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) as it provides a little bit of weapon power that is very valuable. If you have a tiny bit of cash after, put it into survivability. \n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nIdeally, keep staying like an annoying moth on your wall. **BUT** you can play a little more aggressively at this point due to  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) as you can punish the enemy a little bit more. This allows them to keep a radar on you while your team pushes.",
